case: active-tx-only (source mode ACTIVE_TX_ONLY)

The mirror of active-rx-only, and the reason it is a separate case.

TRANSMIT_ONLY and RECEIVE_ONLY are OPERATOR CHOICES, not faults -- the
enum says so in both comments. A mapping that folded either into DEGRADED
would turn a deliberate posture into a logistics signal, which is the
axis confusion ADR-0026 exists to prevent.

Pinning both directions means a future edit cannot quietly collapse them
into one another.
